## 2. 🌐 NETWORK & INTERNET

### **A. INTERNET CONNECTION**

#### **✅ Provider Selection**

**Primary Provider (Wajib):**
- **Telkomsel** (coverage terbaik)
- **Indosat Ooredoo** (alternatif)
- **XL Axiata** (backup)

**Paket Data Rekomendasi:**

| Provider | Paket | Kuota | Harga/Bulan | Kecepatan |
|----------|-------|-------|-------------|-----------|
| Telkomsel | Orbit Max | 100GB | Rp 250.000 | 4G/5G |
| Indosat | Freedom Internet | 75GB | Rp 200.000 | 4G |
| XL | HotRod | 80GB | Rp 220.000 | 4G+ |

**⚠️ CATATAN PENTING:**
- **Video streaming** = boros kuota!
- **YouTube 720p** = ~2GB/jam
- **YouTube 1080p** = ~3-5GB/jam
- **Estimasi:** Bus jalan 8 jam/hari dengan karaoke aktif = 20-40GB/hari

**Rekomendasi Kuota:**
- **Light usage** (2-3 jam/hari): 50GB/bulan
- **Medium usage** (4-6 jam/hari): 100GB/bulan
- **Heavy usage** (8+ jam/hari): 200GB+/bulan

---

#### **✅ Backup Internet (Recommended)**

**Dual SIM Setup:**
- Primary: Telkomsel
- Backup: Indosat/XL
- Auto failover jika primary down

**Hardware:**
- Modem dual-SIM (Teltonika RUT240)
- Atau 2 modem terpisah + router failover

---

#### **✅ Signal Booster (Jika Perlu)**

**External Antenna:**
- 4G LTE Outdoor Antenna
- Gain: 20-30 dBi
- Cable: RG58 atau better
- Harga: Rp 300.000 - Rp 800.000

**Installation:**
- Mount di atap bus
- Connect ke modem via pigtail cable

