---

#### **✅ Browser Setup**

**Google Chrome (Recommended):**

**Extensions Needed:**
- **Auto Refresh Plus** - refresh jika error
- **Full Page Screen Capture** - untuk troubleshooting
- **Video Speed Controller** - jika perlu

**Chrome Flags:**
```
chrome://flags

Enable:
- Hardware-accelerated video decode
- Override software rendering list
- GPU rasterization

Disable:
- Smooth scrolling (reduce lag)
```

**Startup Command:**
```batch
"C:\Program Files\Google\Chrome\Application\chrome.exe" 
  --start-fullscreen 
  --kiosk 
  --disable-infobars 
  --disable-session-crashed-bubble 
  --autoplay-policy=no-user-gesture-required
  "https://your-domain.com/display.html"
```

**Create .bat file untuk auto-start:**
```batch
@echo off
timeout /t 30
start chrome --start-fullscreen --kiosk "https://your-domain.com/display.html"
```

Simpan sebagai `start-karaoke.bat` dan masukkan ke Startup folder.

